# Mobile

- This app wraps the web SPA. Implement finance UX in `client/`, not in Dart.
- Keep branded splash, offline screen, back/double-back, and `AbmitiNative` haptics.
- User-agent should remain identifiable as `AbmitiApp` if server or web checks it.
- Do not commit `key.properties` or keystores. Update `mobile/README.md` when the JS bridge changes.
